    rdfs:comment "Defines the parameters needed to request an offer. Either a tripSearchCriteria, a list of trip specifications, or a list of tripIds can be passed in to request offers.\n\nIf you are searching for fares you pass in the complete trip and the use the requestedSections attribute to define which part(s) you need fares (including virtual border points)."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://vocabulary.eona-x.eu/ontology/osdm/v3.11#> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:minCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; owl:onProperty <https://vocabulary.eona-x.eu/ontology/osdm/v3.11#OfferCollectionRequest.anonymousPassengerSpecifications> ] .

