    rdfs:comment "product selection by product code or product tag for an offer request (exactly one of `productCode` and `productTag` must be provided). The number of items indicates the quantity \nto be required. Passengers must be referenced in case the product is intended for passengers."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://vocabulary.eona-x.eu/ontology/osdm/v3.11#> .

